# Learn: the title's Journey panel, Back to Modes, the mode list, Learn's
# first lesson played by keyboard to the lesson card, the next lesson, then a
# hint and Restart from the HUD, the settings card from the pause card
# (theme select, captions, the runtime's options button) and Resign to the
# results card.
until 300 Arrow Exodus
frames 30
click Journey
until 60 Begin Journey
click Back to Modes
until 60 Modes
save modes
click Learn — interactive lessons, one rule at a time.
until 120 Learn — Send an arrow off
frames 10
key ArrowUp 2
frames 2
key ArrowDown 2
frames 2
key ArrowRight 2
frames 2
key Enter 2
frames 6
until 120 Lesson complete
save lesson
click Next lesson
until 120 Learn — Blocked lanes
key KeyH 2
frames 10
click Restart
frames 10
key Escape 2
until 30 Resume
click Settings
until 30 Captions for sound cues
click Captions for sound cues
frames 5
save settings
click Close
until 30 Resume
click Resign
until 120 Round resigned
save resigned
click Back to Modes
until 60 Modes
